{
 "_readme": [
  "Hand-authored region names for the Mana Map, keyed by CONTENT SIGNATURE rather than",
  "region id. Ids like 'l0_3' are positional: HDBSCAN renumbers on every run, so a name",
  "keyed to one would silently reattach to a different part of the map after a re-cluster.",
  "The signature is '<map>|<level>|<mechanically generated label>', which changes only when",
  "the cluster's actual character changes.",
  "",
  "NAMED FROM MAGIC'S OWN LORE, 2026-09-01, replacing a set of retail and geography puns",
  "('The Discount Bunker', 'Swolesville', 'BOGO - Token Makers'). The scheme:",
  "",
  "  default map  Organised by COLOUR and TYPE, which is how Magic's planes are already",
  "               organised, so each colour gets a canonical realm and its sub-regions are",
  "               places within it. White is Serra's Realm, blue Tolaria, black Urborg and",
  "               Stensia, red Shiv and Keld, green Yavimaya and Llanowar, gold Ravnica,",
  "               colourless Mirrodin. Sub-regions compose MODIFIER + NOUN the way Magic",
  "               names places: 'Stensian Crypts', 'Bogardan Rot Farms', 'Vedalken Denial'.",
  "",
  "  ability map  Organised by MECHANIC, so each macro region gets the lore EVENT or",
  "               INSTITUTION that mechanic belongs to. Counterspells are Tolarian Academy,",
  "               reanimation the Golgari Rot Farms, unblockable is Rath's Shadow (the",
  "               Shadow mechanic is literally Rath's), and entering the battlefield is the",
  "               Blind Eternities. Sub-regions take a mechanic as their modifier:",
  "               'Seeking Groves', 'Servitor Perch', 'Warded Silence'.",
  "",
  "  quadrants    A cluster HDBSCAN split into (North)/(South)/(East)/(West) is ONE place in",
  "               four corners and shares its base name. An earlier pass seeded each",
  "               direction separately and produced 'East Time Rift' beside 'West Sanctum",
  "               of Foresight' for two halves of the same region.",
  "",
  "  gold         Ravnica's guilds are DEFINED by mechanic, so the guild follows the",
  "               mechanic rather than a hash: Boros for attack triggers, Izzet for card",
  "               draw, Golgari for graveyards, Simic for counters, Orzhov for lifegain.",
  "",
  "A region with no entry here keeps its mechanical name and is REPORTED by",
  "`manamap cluster-regions`, so a re-cluster degrades visibly instead of quietly losing",
  "its names. Neighbourhoods (level 2) are named procedurally from their parent -- there are",
  "410 of them across both maps, and a bad joke repeated 400 times is worse than none.",
  "",
  "label = what you read when zoomed to that level. short = the map annotation."
 ],
